msgid "## Feature Introduction"
msgstr "## 特性介绍"

msgid ""
"Fine-Grained Tensor Parallelism (Fine-grained TP) extends standard tensor "
"parallelism with **independent tensor-parallel sizes for different model "
"components** — embedding, LM head, attention output projection (o_proj), and"
" MLP blocks — configured via the `finegrained_tp_config` parameter. Instead "
"of a single global `tensor_parallel_size`, each component is sharded along "
"the data-parallel (DP) axis with its own size, reducing per-device weight "
"memory. The feature supports MoE models only."
msgstr ""
"细粒度张量并行（Fine-grained TP）在标准张量并行基础上进行了扩展，支持**为不同模型组件设置独立的张量并行大小**——包括 "
"embedding、LM head、注意力输出投影（o_proj）和 MLP 块——通过 `finegrained_tp_config` "
"参数进行配置。与使用单一的全局 `tensor_parallel_size` "
"不同，每个组件沿数据并行（DP）轴按其自身大小进行分片，从而降低单设备权重内存占用。该特性仅支持 MoE 模型。"

msgid ""
"In the measured DeepSeek-R1-W8A8 deployment below, the four knobs together "
"saved **9.72 GB per card** with a net TPOT improvement (see [Experimental "
"Results](#experimental-results)). In decode-heavy workloads, where GEMMs are"
" memory-bound, the smaller per-device weights also reduce the weight-read "
"volume per step for the sharded GEMM modules (LM head, o_proj, and MLP)."
msgstr ""
"在下方实测的 DeepSeek-R1-W8A8 部署中，四个开关共同节省了**每卡 9.72 GB** 内存，并带来了 TPOT "
"的净提升（参见[实验结果](#experimental-results)）。在以 decode 为主的工作负载中，GEMM "
"受内存带宽限制，更小的单设备权重也降低了分片 GEMM 模块（LM head、o_proj 和 MLP）每步的权重读取量。"

msgid "### Working Principle"
msgstr "### 工作原理"

msgid ""
"All four knobs shard weights over a process group built along the DP axis, "
"and every rank of that group joins the exchange on every engine step. The "
"four components fall into two families with different exchange contracts, "
"and the family a knob belongs to determines where it can run:"
msgstr ""
"四个开关均沿 DP 轴构建的进程组对权重进行分片，该进程组中的每个 rank "
"在引擎的每一步都会参与交换。这四个组件分为两类，具有不同的交换约定，开关所属的类别决定了其可运行的场景："

msgid ""
"- **embedding / LM head (fixed-capacity exchanges)**: the exchange always runs at a fixed, deployment-wide capacity regardless of the real per-step token count, and the padding tail is trimmed afterwards. For embedding, the op pads token IDs to `max(potential_max_tokens, max_num_batched_tokens)` before an `all_gather`, looks up its vocabulary shard, and `reduce_scatter`s the embeddings back to the original owners — prefill-sized steps included. For the LM head, the runner pads the sampled hidden-state rows to `max_num_reqs * decode_query_len` before `all_gather → vocab-sharded GEMM → all_to_all`, and idle DP ranks join through a dummy `compute_logits` at the same capacity. Because the collective shapes never depend on the step, these knobs work in eager and graph mode, in both prefill and decode.\n"
"- **o_proj / MLP (per-step exchanges that require decode-shaped steps)**: the exchange is sized by the actual step. MLP runs plain `all_gather` (gate_up) / `reduce_scatter` (down) whose shapes follow the real token count, so every rank in the group must forward the same number of tokens on every step. o_proj pads to a static capacity — `potential_max_tokens`, the deployment-wide step bound (the largest cudagraph capture size, and at least the largest decode-shaped step) — and fails explicitly beyond it. These knobs are supported only in graph-dispatched P/D decode deployments, where steps stay decode-shaped and aligned across the DP group — see the [preconditions](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp) and the runtime guard against eagerly dispatched steps."
msgstr ""
"- **embedding / LM head（固定容量交换）**：无论每步实际的 token 数量是多少，交换始终以固定的、部署范围内统一的容量运行，随后裁剪掉填充部分。对于 embedding，该算子先将 token ID 填充到 `max(potential_max_tokens, max_num_batched_tokens)`，然后执行 `all_gather`，查找其词表分片，再通过 `reduce_scatter` 将 embedding 归还原属主——包括 prefill 规模的步。对于 LM head，runner 先将采样得到的 hidden-state 行填充到 `max_num_reqs * decode_query_len`，然后执行 `all_gather → 词表分片 GEMM → all_to_all`，空闲的 DP rank 通过相同容量的 dummy `compute_logits` 参与。由于集合通信的形状从不依赖于具体的步，这些开关在 eager 模式和 graph 模式下、在 prefill 和 decode 中均可工作。\n"
"- **o_proj / MLP（按步交换，要求 decode 形状的步）**：交换的大小由实际的步决定。MLP 执行普通的 `all_gather`（gate_up）/ `reduce_scatter`（down），其形状跟随真实的 token 数量，因此进程组中的每个 rank 在每一步都必须前向相同数量的 token。o_proj 填充到静态容量——`potential_max_tokens`，即部署范围内的步上界（最大的 cudagraph 捕获大小，且至少为最大的 decode 形状步）——超出该容量则显式报错。这些开关仅在 graph 调度的 P/D decode 部署中受支持，此时步保持 decode 形状并在 DP 组内对齐——参见[前置条件](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp)以及针对 eager 调度步的运行时保护。"

msgid "### Usage Scenarios"
msgstr "### 使用场景"

msgid ""
"Fine-grained TP is designed for the **decode instance** of PD separation, "
"where models are typically deployed in all-DP mode. The four knobs are "
"freely combinable — on a PD decode node all four can be enabled together "
"(this is the configuration measured in [Experimental Results](#experimental-"
"results)); each knob only needs to satisfy its own family's constraints."
msgstr ""
"细粒度 TP 专为 PD 分离中的 **decode 实例**设计，此类场景下模型通常以全 DP 模式部署。四个开关可自由组合——在 PD decode"
" 节点上可同时启用全部四个（这正是[实验结果](#experimental-results)中实测的配置）；每个开关只需满足其所属类别的约束即可。"

msgid "| Scenario | Components that can be enabled | Applicable Conditions |"
msgstr "| 场景 | 可启用的组件 | 适用条件 |"

msgid ""
"| MoE serving with embedding / LM head TP — a standalone instance "
"(optionally stacked with standard TP) or a PD decode node | embedding / LM "
"head | MoE model, sizes evenly divide `data_parallel_size` |"
msgstr ""
"| 使用 embedding / LM head TP 的 MoE 服务——独立实例（可选叠加标准 TP）或 PD decode 节点 | "
"embedding / LM head | MoE 模型，各大小可整除 `data_parallel_size` |"

msgid ""
"| P/D-disaggregated decode (D) node with all four knobs | o_proj / MLP / "
"embedding / LM head | The o_proj / MLP knobs require the full [preconditions"
" for o_proj / MLP TP](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp) |"
msgstr ""
"| 启用全部四个开关的 P/D 分离 decode（D）节点 | o_proj / MLP / embedding / LM head | o_proj"
" / MLP 开关需要满足完整的 [o_proj / MLP TP 前置条件](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp) |"

msgid "#### Component & Execution Mode Support"
msgstr "#### 组件与执行模式支持"

msgid "| TP config     | Eager | Graph | Prefill | Decode |"
msgstr "| TP 配置     | Eager | Graph | Prefill | Decode |"

