"| Model | MoE models only — see [Models](#models) for how to check a "
"checkpoint |"
msgstr "| 模型 | 仅支持 MoE 模型——关于如何检查 checkpoint，参见[模型](#models) |"

msgid ""
"| Deployment Scenario | embedding / LM head TP: standalone MoE serving "
"(optionally stacked with standard TP) or PD decode nodes; o_proj / MLP TP: "
"P/D-disaggregated decode nodes only |"
msgstr ""
"| 部署场景 | embedding / LM head TP：独立 MoE 服务（可选叠加标准 TP）或 PD decode 节点；o_proj / "
"MLP TP：仅限 P/D 分离的 decode 节点 |"

msgid ""
"| Standard TP | o_proj / MLP TP cannot be combined with standard TP "
"(`tensor_parallel_size == 1` required, enforced at config load); embedding /"
" LM head TP can be combined with standard TP; see [Standard Tensor "
