msgstr ""
"| 硬件 | 无配置层面的硬件限制；本指南中的性能数据在 Atlas A2 上测得（参见[实验结果](#experimental-results)） |"

msgid "#### Models"
msgstr "#### 模型"

msgid ""
"Fine-grained TP currently supports **MoE models only**. The constraint is "
"enforced at configuration load: a non-MoE model fails at startup with `The "
"finegrained tp sizes can be enabled only for MOE models.`"
msgstr ""
"细粒度 TP 目前**仅支持 MoE 模型**。该约束在配置加载时强制执行：非 MoE 模型会在启动时失败，并报错 `The finegrained "
"tp sizes can be enabled only for MOE models.`"

msgid ""
"To check whether a checkpoint qualifies, look at its `config.json`: the "
"model counts as a MoE model when the config exposes routed experts through "
"any of the fields `n_routed_experts` (DeepSeek-style), `num_local_experts` "
"(Mixtral-style), `num_experts`, `moe_num_experts`, or MoE blocks under "
"`block_configs`. Checkpoints such as DeepSeek-V3/R1, the Qwen3 MoE series, "
"GLM MoE variants, Kimi-K2, and MiniMax-M3 qualify; dense checkpoints such as"
" Llama or the dense Qwen series do not."
msgstr ""
"要检查某个 checkpoint 是否符合条件，请查看其 `config.json`：当配置通过以下任一字段暴露路由专家时，该模型即被视为 MoE "
"模型——`n_routed_experts`（DeepSeek 风格）、`num_local_experts`（Mixtral "
"风格）、`num_experts`、`moe_num_experts`，或 `block_configs` 下的 MoE 块。符合条件的 "
"checkpoint 包括 DeepSeek-V3/R1、Qwen3 MoE 系列、GLM MoE 变体、Kimi-K2 和 MiniMax-M3；而 "
"Llama 或稠密 Qwen 系列等稠密 checkpoint 则不符合条件。"

msgid ""
"The restriction comes from the sharding axis: fine-grained TP shards weights"
" across the data-parallel (DP) dimension, and only MoE deployments keep a "
"cross-rank DP group — for a dense model, every DP rank runs as an "
"independent DP=1 engine, leaving no group to shard across."
msgstr ""
"该限制源于切分轴：细粒度 TP 在数据并行（DP）维度上切分权重，而只有 MoE 部署会保留跨 rank 的 DP 组——对于稠密模型，每个 DP "
"rank 都作为独立的 DP=1 引擎运行，没有可供切分的组。"

msgid ""
"Within a qualifying MoE model, `mlp_tensor_parallel_size` shards the dense "
"MLP layers — for example, the first three dense layers of DeepSeek-R1; the "
"routed experts of the MoE layers are sharded by expert parallel instead, and"
" shared experts stay replicated."
msgstr ""
"在符合条件的 MoE 模型中，`mlp_tensor_parallel_size` 会切分稠密 MLP 层——例如 DeepSeek-R1 "
"的前三个稠密层；MoE 层的路由专家则由专家并行进行切分，共享专家保持复制。"

msgid "#### Preconditions for o_proj / MLP TP"
msgstr "#### o_proj / MLP TP 的前提条件"

msgid ""
"`oproj_tensor_parallel_size > 1` and `mlp_tensor_parallel_size > 1` are "
"validated at startup and require all of the following (invalid "
"configurations fail at config load with an explicit error):"
msgstr ""
"`oproj_tensor_parallel_size > 1` 和 `mlp_tensor_parallel_size > 1` "
"会在启动时进行校验，并且需要满足以下所有条件（无效配置会在配置加载时以明确的错误信息失败）："

msgid ""
"- a MoE model with `tensor_parallel_size == 1` (and a `data_parallel_size` that the TP size evenly divides);\n"
"- a P/D-disaggregated deployment, on the decode (D) node only (`kv_role = kv_consumer`);\n"
"- the recompute scheduler: `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable = true` in `--additional-config` (it keeps decode-node steps decode-shaped);\n"
"- `PreemptOffloadConnector` in the KV connector chain — combine the P/D transfer connector (e.g. `MooncakeConnectorV1`) and `PreemptOffloadConnector` via `MultiConnector` (a preempted request must not return to the prefill node: the recomputed KV loses precision); see the [Preempt Offload Guide](preempt_offload_connector.md);\n"
"- a graph mode: do not start the instance with `--enforce-eager`;\n"
"- `prefill_context_parallel_size == 1`."
msgstr ""
"- 一个 `tensor_parallel_size == 1` 的 MoE 模型（并且 `data_parallel_size` 能被 TP 大小整除）；\n"
"- 一个 P/D 分离部署，且仅在 decode（D）节点上（`kv_role = kv_consumer`）；\n"
"- 重计算调度器：在 `--additional-config` 中设置 `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable = true`（它保持 decode 节点的 step 为 decode 形态）；\n"
"- KV connector 链中的 `PreemptOffloadConnector`——通过 `MultiConnector` 将 P/D 传输 connector（例如 `MooncakeConnectorV1`）与 `PreemptOffloadConnector` 组合使用（被抢占的请求不得返回 prefill 节点：重计算的 KV 会丢失精度）；参见 [Preempt Offload 指南](preempt_offload_connector.md)；\n"
"- 图模式：不要使用 `--enforce-eager` 启动实例；\n"
"- `prefill_context_parallel_size == 1`。"

msgid ""
"If the largest cudagraph capture size does not cover the largest decode-"
"shaped step (`min(max_num_batched_tokens, max_num_seqs * (1 + "
"num_speculative_tokens))`), both `oproj_tensor_parallel_size` and "
"`mlp_tensor_parallel_size` are **disabled automatically at startup with a "
"warning**, and the deployment still starts without them; raise "
"`max_cudagraph_capture_size` to re-enable. At runtime, a step dispatched "
"outside the captured graphs fails loudly with an explicit error instead of "
"silently hanging the cross-DP collectives."
msgstr ""
"如果最大的 cudagraph 捕获尺寸无法覆盖最大的 decode 形态 step（`min(max_num_batched_tokens, "
"max_num_seqs * (1 + num_speculative_tokens))`），则 "
"`oproj_tensor_parallel_size` 和 `mlp_tensor_parallel_size` "
"都会**在启动时自动禁用并给出警告**，部署仍会在不启用它们的情况下启动；提高 `max_cudagraph_capture_size` "
"可重新启用。在运行时，若某个 step 被派发到已捕获图之外，会以明确的错误信息显式失败，而不是静默挂起跨 DP 集合通信。"

msgid "#### LM Head TP and Speculative Decoding"
msgstr "#### LM Head TP 与投机解码"

msgid ""
"LM head TP works with EAGLE, DFlash, and DSpark draft models. A few "
"combinations are not aligned with the group-row padding yet and fail fast at"
" construction with an explicit error stating the reason — these are current "
"scope decisions rather than defects:"
msgstr ""
"LM head TP 可与 EAGLE、DFlash 和 DSpark 草稿模型配合使用。有少数组合尚未与 group-row padding "
"对齐，会在构造时快速失败并给出说明原因的明确错误——这些是当前的范围决策，而非缺陷："

msgid ""
"- DFlash2 draft models;\n"
"- `draft_sample_method = \"probabilistic\"`;\n"
"- `use_local_argmax_reduction`;\n"
"- `enable_adaptive_verification`."
msgstr ""
"- DFlash2 草稿模型；\n"
"- `draft_sample_method = \"probabilistic\"`；\n"
"- `use_local_argmax_reduction`；\n"
"- `enable_adaptive_verification`。"

msgid ""
"Prompt logprobs is also not supported with LM head TP: a request asking for "
"prompt logprobs fails with an explicit error at sampling time."
msgstr "LM head TP 也不支持 prompt logprobs：请求 prompt logprobs 会在采样时以明确的错误信息失败。"

msgid "#### Configuration Limit"
msgstr "#### 配置限制"

msgid ""
"Violating these constraints fails at configuration load with `finegrained tp"
" sizes must divide by data_parallel_size.`"
msgstr ""
"违反这些约束会在配置加载时以 `finegrained tp sizes must divide by data_parallel_size.` 失败。"

msgid "#### Standard Tensor Parallelism Requirement"
msgstr "#### 标准张量并行要求"

msgid ""
"Fine-grained TP shards the configured layer **across the data-parallel (DP) "
"dimension**, not the standard tensor-parallel (TP) dimension. Whether a knob"
" can be combined with standard TP therefore differs per component:"
msgstr ""
"细粒度 TP 将所配置的层**在数据并行（DP）维度上**切分，而非标准张量并行（TP）维度。因此，某个开关能否与标准 TP 组合使用因组件而异："

msgid ""
"| `o_proj` / `mlp` | **Cannot be combined — rejected at config load.** For "
"`o_proj`, the DSA attention output is reshaped with `n_local_groups = "
"n_groups // tp_size` (standard TP), while the wo_a/wo_b weights are sharded "
"by the OTP group (DP dimension); the two axes no longer align (for MLP, the "
"combination is simply untested). Both knobs require `tensor_parallel_size =="
" 1`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `o_proj` / `mlp` | **不能组合——在配置加载时被拒绝。** 对于 `o_proj`，DSA attention 输出使用 "
"`n_local_groups = n_groups // tp_size`（标准 TP）进行 reshape，而 wo_a/wo_b 权重由 OTP "
"组（DP 维度）切分；这两个轴不再对齐（对于 MLP，该组合只是未经测试）。这两个开关都要求 `tensor_parallel_size == 1`。 "
"|"

msgid ""
"| `embedding` / LM head | **Can be combined.** With a knob enabled, these "
"modules always resolve to the fine-grained plan: their weights are sharded "
"by the fine-grained (DP-axis, fixed `tp_idx`) group — `vocab / "
"fine_grained_size` per rank — replacing the standard TP sharding of these "
"modules instead of composing with it. Scenario 1 shows a stacked example. |"
msgstr ""
"| `embedding` / LM head | **可以组合。** 启用某个开关后，这些模块始终解析为细粒度方案：其权重由细粒度（DP 轴，固定 "
"`tp_idx`）组切分——每个 rank 为 `vocab / fine_grained_size`——取代这些模块的标准 TP "
"切分，而不是与之叠加。场景 1 展示了一个叠加示例。 |"

msgid "## Feature Usage"
msgstr "## 功能使用"

msgid "### Usage Example"
msgstr "### 使用示例"

msgid ""
"#### Scenario 1 — embedding + LM head TP, stacked with standard TP "
"(standalone MoE serving)"
msgstr "#### 场景 1 — embedding + LM head TP，与标准 TP 叠加（独立 MoE 服务）"

msgid ""
"embedding / LM head TP are the two knobs that can be combined with standard "
"`tensor_parallel_size` (o_proj / MLP TP cannot — see [Standard Tensor "
"Parallelism Requirement](#standard-tensor-parallelism-requirement)); "
"stacking them with standard TP splits the dense weights across TP ranks as "
"usual, giving a standalone instance more KV headroom per card. For decode-"
"throughput production deployments, the recommended topology is still the "
"P/D-disaggregated decode node shown in Scenario 2."
msgstr ""
"embedding / LM head TP 是可以与标准 `tensor_parallel_size` 组合使用的两个开关（o_proj / MLP "
"TP 则不能——参见[标准张量并行要求](#standard-tensor-parallelism-requirement)）；将它们与标准 TP "
"叠加会像往常一样在 TP rank 之间切分稠密权重，从而为独立实例提供每卡更多的 KV 余量。对于以 decode "
"吞吐为目标的生产部署，推荐的拓扑仍然是场景 2 所示的 P/D 分离 decode 节点。"

msgid "#### Scenario 2 — all four knobs on a P/D-disaggregated decode node"
msgstr "#### 场景 2 — 在 P/D 分离 decode 节点上启用全部四个开关"

msgid "### Verifying the Feature"
msgstr "### 验证功能"

msgid ""
"After the instance starts, check which knobs passed startup validation:"
msgstr "实例启动后，检查哪些开关通过了启动校验："

msgid "1. Check the startup log for the enabled-knob summary:"
msgstr "1. 检查启动日志中的已启用开关摘要："

msgid "Expected output (Scenario 1):"
msgstr "预期输出（场景 1）："

msgid "Expected output (Scenario 2):"
msgstr "预期输出（场景 2）："

msgid ""
"Only the knobs that passed the startup checks are listed; the format is "
"`knob=size` (for the interplay with `tensor_parallel_size`, see [Standard "
"Tensor Parallelism Requirement](#standard-tensor-parallelism-requirement))."
msgstr ""
"仅列出通过启动检查的开关；格式为 `knob=size`（关于与 `tensor_parallel_size` "
"的相互作用，参见[标准张量并行要求](#standard-tensor-parallelism-requirement)）。"

msgid ""
"2. If `oproj_tensor_parallel_size` / `mlp_tensor_parallel_size` are missing "
"from that line, check for the capture-bound auto-disable warning:"
msgstr ""
"2. 如果该行中缺少 `oproj_tensor_parallel_size` / "
"`mlp_tensor_parallel_size`，请检查是否存在捕获上限自动禁用警告："

msgid ""
"It fires when the largest cudagraph capture size does not cover the largest "
"decode-shaped step; raise `max_cudagraph_capture_size` to re-enable both "
"knobs."
msgstr ""
"当最大的 cudagraph 捕获尺寸无法覆盖最大的 decode 形态 step 时，该警告会触发；提高 "
"`max_cudagraph_capture_size` 可重新启用这两个开关。"

msgid ""
"3. Send an inference request to confirm the service serves normally with the"
" knobs on (any standard client works):"
msgstr "3. 发送一个推理请求，以确认在开启这些开关的情况下服务能正常提供服务（任何标准客户端均可）："

msgid "Expected result: HTTP 200 with a `choices` field in the response."
msgstr "预期结果：HTTP 200，且响应中包含 `choices` 字段。"

msgid "## Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "## 配置参数"

msgid ""
"All knobs live under `finegrained_tp_config` inside `--additional-config`. "
"The default `0` disables a knob."
msgstr ""
"所有开关均位于 `--additional-config` 中的 `finegrained_tp_config` 下。默认值 `0` 表示禁用该开关。"

msgid "| Parameter | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `oproj_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | No | 0, or a divisor of "
"`data_parallel_size` | TP size of the attention output projection (`o_proj`,"
" or the two-stage `wo_a`/`wo_b` in DSA-style models). Values > 1 require the"
" [o_proj / MLP preconditions](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp). |"
msgstr ""
"| `oproj_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | 否 | 0，或 `data_parallel_size` 的约数 "
"| 注意力输出投影（`o_proj`，或 DSA 类模型中的两阶段 `wo_a`/`wo_b`）的 TP 大小。取值 > 1 时需要满足 [o_proj"
" / MLP 前置条件](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp)。 |"

msgid ""
"| `mlp_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | No | 0, or a divisor of "
"`data_parallel_size` | TP size of the MLP (feed-forward) blocks. Values > 1 "
"require the [o_proj / MLP preconditions](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp)."
" |"
msgstr ""
"| `mlp_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | 否 | 0，或 `data_parallel_size` 的约数 | "
"MLP（前馈）模块的 TP 大小。取值 > 1 时需要满足 [o_proj / MLP 前置条件](#preconditions-for-o_proj"
"--mlp-tp)。 |"

msgid ""
"| `lmhead_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | No | 0, or a divisor of "
"`data_parallel_size` | TP size of the LM head (shards the vocabulary "
"dimension). |"
msgstr ""
"| `lmhead_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | 否 | 0，或 `data_parallel_size` 的约数"
" | LM head 的 TP 大小（对词表维度进行切分）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `embedding_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | No | 0, or a divisor of "
"`data_parallel_size` | TP size of the token embedding table. |"
msgstr ""
"| `embedding_tensor_parallel_size` | int | 0 | 否 | 0，或 `data_parallel_size` "
"的约数 | token 嵌入表的 TP 大小。 |"

msgid ""
"To evaluate the effectiveness of fine-grained TP in large-scale serving, we "
"deploy P/D-disaggregated decode instances of **DeepSeek-R1-W8A8** on 32 "
"Ascend Atlas A2 inference cards (64 GB per card), with DP32+EP32 and a fine-"
"grained TP size of 8. The performance data is as follows."
msgstr ""
"为评估细粒度 TP 在大规模推理服务中的效果，我们在 32 张昇腾 Atlas A2 推理卡（每卡 64 GB）上部署了 "
"**DeepSeek-R1-W8A8** 的 P/D 分离 decode 实例，采用 DP32+EP32 以及细粒度 TP 大小为 8。性能数据如下。"

msgid "| MLP TP = 8 | 0.9 GB         | **−1.0 ms** (improvement) |"
msgstr "| MLP TP = 8 | 0.9 GB         | **−1.0 ms**（提升） |"

msgid ""
"- Memory savings per card are the primary gain; TPOT sees a small net "
"improvement."
msgstr "- 每卡显存节省是主要收益；TPOT 也有小幅净提升。"

msgid "## FAQs"
msgstr "## 常见问题"

msgid ""
"### Startup fails with \"The finegrained tp sizes can be enabled only for "
"MOE models.\""
msgstr ""
"### 启动失败，报错 \"The finegrained tp sizes can be enabled only for MOE models.\""

msgid ""
"**Problem Description**: With any `finegrained_tp_config` size set, the "
"instance fails at configuration load with this error."
msgstr "**问题描述**：设置了任意 `finegrained_tp_config` 大小后，实例在加载配置时因该错误而失败。"

msgid ""
"**Cause Analysis**: The checkpoint is not a MoE model — fine-grained TP "
"shards weights across the DP dimension, which only exists as a cross-rank "
"group for MoE deployments."
msgstr ""
"**原因分析**：该 checkpoint 不是 MoE 模型——细粒度 TP 会沿 DP 维度对权重进行切分，而该维度仅在 MoE 部署中作为跨 "
"rank 组存在。"

msgid ""
"**Solution Steps**: Check the checkpoint’s `config.json` for the expert "
"fields listed in [Models](#models). If none are present, the model is dense "
"and fine-grained TP cannot be enabled; use standard `tensor_parallel_size` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"**解决步骤**：检查 checkpoint 的 `config.json` 中是否存在 [模型](#models) "
"所列的专家字段。如果都不存在，则该模型为稠密模型，无法启用细粒度 TP；请改用标准的 `tensor_parallel_size`。"

msgid ""
"### o_proj / MLP TP are missing from the \"finegrained_tp_config enabled\" "
"log line"
msgstr "### \"finegrained_tp_config enabled\" 日志行中缺少 o_proj / MLP TP"

msgid ""
"**Problem Description**: The service starts normally, but the startup "
"summary only lists embedding / LM head (or is empty) although "
"`oproj_tensor_parallel_size` / `mlp_tensor_parallel_size` were configured."
msgstr ""
"**问题描述**：服务正常启动，但尽管已配置 `oproj_tensor_parallel_size` / "
"`mlp_tensor_parallel_size`，启动摘要中只列出了 embedding / LM head（或为空）。"

msgid ""
"**Cause Analysis**: The largest cudagraph capture size does not cover the "
"largest decode-shaped step, so both knobs were auto-disabled with a warning."
msgstr "**原因分析**：最大的 cudagraph 捕获大小未覆盖最大的 decode 形态 step，因此这两个开关被自动禁用并给出警告。"

msgid ""
"**Solution Steps**: Raise `max_cudagraph_capture_size` (or lower "
"`max_num_batched_tokens` / `max_num_seqs`) so the capture bound covers "
"`min(max_num_batched_tokens, max_num_seqs * (1 + num_speculative_tokens))`, "
"then restart."
msgstr ""
"**解决步骤**：调高 `max_cudagraph_capture_size`（或调低 `max_num_batched_tokens` / "
"`max_num_seqs`），使捕获上限覆盖 `min(max_num_batched_tokens, max_num_seqs * (1 + "
"num_speculative_tokens))`，然后重启。"

msgid "### Startup fails on an o_proj / MLP precondition error"
msgstr "### 启动失败，报 o_proj / MLP 前置条件错误"

msgid ""
"**Problem Description**: With `oproj_tensor_parallel_size > 1` or "
"`mlp_tensor_parallel_size > 1`, configuration load raises an error about one"
" of the preconditions (graph mode, the PD scenario, the recompute scheduler,"
" `PreemptOffloadConnector`, `tensor_parallel_size`, or PCP)."
msgstr ""
"**问题描述**：当 `oproj_tensor_parallel_size > 1` 或 `mlp_tensor_parallel_size > 1`"
" 时，加载配置会抛出关于某一前置条件的错误（图模式、PD "
"场景、重计算调度器、`PreemptOffloadConnector`、`tensor_parallel_size` 或 PCP）。"

msgid ""
"**Cause Analysis**: One or more of the [preconditions for o_proj / MLP "
"TP](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp) are not met."
msgstr ""
"**原因分析**：未满足 [o_proj / MLP TP 的前置条件](#preconditions-for-o_proj--mlp-tp) "
"中的一项或多项。"

msgid ""
"**Solution Steps**: Follow the preconditions checklist; the most commonly "
"missed items are `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable = true` and "
"the `PreemptOffloadConnector` entry in the `MultiConnector` chain (see "
"Scenario 2 above)."
msgstr ""
"**解决步骤**：按照前置条件清单逐项检查；最常被遗漏的项是 `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable "
"= true` 以及 `MultiConnector` 链中的 `PreemptOffloadConnector` 条目（参见上文场景 2）。"
